DESCRIPTION:Honor our local heroes and support Asheville High Football as 
 they take on the Watauga Pioneers on Friday\, September 26th!This game is
  more than just a competition. As we mark the one-year anniversary of Hurr
 icane Helene\, we want to take a moment to honor the brave first responder
 s who worked tirelessly to keep our community safe in the aftermath of the
  hurricane. To say thank you\, all first responders with proof of identifi
 cation will receive free admission to the game.Let's pack the stands at As
 heville High and cheer on our Cougars while we celebrate the strength and 
 resilience of our community. GO COUGARS!
LOCATION:Asheville High School\, 419 McDowell St\, Asheville\, NC 28803\, U
 SA
SUMMARY:First Responder Night 
END:VEVENT
